{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24331","headline":"宿香山寺酬广陵牛相公见寄 · 白居易","name":"宿香山寺酬广陵牛相公见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"手札八行诗一篇，无由相见但依然。\n君匡圣主方行道，我事空王正坐禅。\n支许徒思游白月，夔龙未放下青天。\n应须且爲苍生住，犹去悬车十四年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}